    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="struct_pm_pll_context" kindref="compound">PmPllContext</ref> - Structure for saving context of PLL registers. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>         Contains variable to store default content of:
</verbatim>  Control register  Configuration register  Fractional control register  Indicates context saved or not</para><para>Note: context of the PLL is saved when PM framework suspends a PLL (when no node requires PLL to be locked). </para>    </detaileddescription>
